# transformed-5k (M13b): transformed (R3, a 2, h -1, k 1, P at 0.5, in midnight-violet, the curve
# glowing over the dashed original) full screen on a 5K display, 2560 x 1440 at density 2: the
# heaviest redraw M6 timed, timed on the release build at both sizes (README: Release). The panel
# keeps its width and its rows their places at any height, so transformed's clicks and typing apply
# unchanged: the boxes' fields (a's at 383, 424; k's 468; h's 573), P's readout field (330, 690),
# typed on both sides since M8 as transformed's is, and the top bar's empty middle (760, 48).
size 2560 1440
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme midnight-violet
wait 300
click 383 424
wait 16
type "2"
key Enter
click 383 468
wait 16
type "1"
key Enter
click 383 573
wait 16
type "-1"
key Enter
click 330 690
wait 16
type "0.5"
key Enter
click 760 48
wait 2000
shot transformed
